<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n75600" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὄστλιγξ</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ιγγος</span>,
			ἡ, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>hair</i>, esp. <i>curled hair, lock of hair</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Call.
				<u>Fr.</u>
				12
			</span></i>; cf. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἄστλιγξ.</span>
		</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>anything curled</i> or <i>twisted</i>, as, </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>1.</b>
			<i>tendril</i> of vine and other climbing plants, <i><span class="en">
				Thphr.
				<u>HP</u>
				3.18.5
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>curling flame</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πυρός</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					A.R.
					1.1297
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b> of the
				<i>arms</i> of the cuttle-fish, <i><span class="en">
				Nic.
				<u>Al.</u>
				470
			</span></i>.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
